      //    - Time accumulator prevents timer drift or stutter
      //    - Initial entry: 001 -> 042 smooth normal speed, zero slowdown/holds
      //    - Idle loop: Strictly 42 <-> 40 (42 -> 41 -> 40 -> 41 -> 42)
